      "job_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/search-results/?currentJobId=4388503331&eBP=NOT_ELIGIBLE_FOR_CHARGING&refId=LE7kw4suGyXLYJw69TY5Zw%3D%3D&trackingId=BJuksurrzS%2BFhAeyIPmBKQ%3D%3D&keywords=ai%20fresher%20&origin=JOB_SEARCH_PAGE_JOB_FILTER&referralSearchId=9Uo3cM4HnsecovHUKG4BvQ%3D%3D&f_SAL=f_SA_id_230001%3A276008",
